<div id="text-6a0a7f2f3e" class="cmp-text">
    <h3>Europe Oil and Gas Deal of the Year</h3>
<p>Mitsui O.S.K Lines (MOL) acquisition of LBC Tank Terminals<sup><a href="#footnote-2">2</a></sup></p>

