<div class="accordion panelcontainer aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12"><div class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-component="accordion">
  
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
      <div class="cmp-accordion__header">
        <button class="cmp-accordion__button" id="accordion-a8b977ac1c-item-3d91d5f0e2" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
          <div class="cmp-accordion__header-content">
            <p class="cmp-accordion__title">
              Advisory
            </p>
            <p class="cmp-accordion__icon"></p>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" data-component="accordionItem" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region"><div class="accordionItem container responsivegrid">

    
    
    
    <div id="accordionItem-3d91d5f0e2" class="cmp-container">
        
        <div class="text"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-9737907166" class="cmp-text">
    <p><span class="p1-medium">Industry coverage and Mergers and acquisitions</span></p>
<p>Industry sector experts advising corporates, institutions and governments on strategic and financial matters including M&amp;A, divestments and takeover responses, along with specialist projects and partnerships.<br />
<br />
</p>
<p><span class="p1-medium">Capital structure and raising</span></p>
<p>Specialised local capabilities in capital raisings across private and public capital, including debt and equity, capital structure advisory and restructuring.<br />
<br />
</p>
<p><span class="p1-medium">Equity execution and research</span></p>
<p>Award-winning equities research, sales, corporate access, execution, transition management, risk trading and syndicate.</p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--tertiary cmp-cta--long light green  p2" href="/uk/en/about/company/macquarie-capital/equities.html" target="_self" title="Learn more about our Equities capabilities">
        
        <span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">Learn more about our Equities capabilities</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>

        
    </div>

</div>
</div>
    </div>
  
    <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item">
      <div class="cmp-accordion__header">
        <button class="cmp-accordion__button" id="accordion-a8b977ac1c-item-2bf541ddf3" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
          <div class="cmp-accordion__header-content">
            <p class="cmp-accordion__title">
              Investing
            </p>
            <p class="cmp-accordion__icon"></p>
            
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" data-component="accordionItem" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden" role="region"><div class="accordionItem container responsivegrid">

    
    
    
    <div id="accordionItem-2bf541ddf3" class="cmp-container">
        
        <div class="text"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-5df97f24c0" class="cmp-text">
    <p><span class="p1-medium">Private credit</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Capital and debt solutions tailored to suit complex financial needs, backed by Macquarie’s balance sheet. This includes senior debt, junior debt, structured debt, corporate borrowers and real estate borrowers.</span><br />
 </p>
<p><span class="p1-medium">Infrastructure</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Development and investment capital in infrastructure and energy projects and companies, with a focus on digital infrastructure and the energy transition.</span><br />
 </p>
<p><span class="p1-medium">Technology and growth equity</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Focused growth equity and buyout in late-stage, technology and tech-enabled companies serving businesses and the public sector.</span><br />
 </p>
<p><span class="p1-medium">Venture capital</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Early-stage venture capital to innovative software companies headquartered in Australia, Europe and Israel.</span></p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--tertiary cmp-cta--long light blue  p2" href="/uk/en/about/company/macquarie-capital/venture-capital.html" target="_self" title="Learn more about venture capital team">
        
        <span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">Learn more about venture capital team</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>
<div class="text"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-d991da0e22" class="cmp-text">
    <p><br />
<span class="p1-medium">Private equity</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Mature equity investments, control, co-control, minority, platform funding, corporate and real estate equity investments that impact communities and markets.</span></p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="cta">
    
      <a class="cmp-cta cmp-cta--tertiary cmp-cta--long light blue  p2" href="/uk/en/about/company/macquarie-capital/private-equity-investment.html" target="_self" title="Discover the Private Equity Investment Europe team">
        
        <span class="icon-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="cmp-cta__text">Discover the Private Equity Investment Europe team</span>
        
      </a>



    

</div>
<div class="text"><div class="dark-text">
    
<div id="text-3362b19b20" class="cmp-text">
    <p><br />
<span class="p1-medium">Real Estate</span></p>
<p><span class="p2">Our real estate team provides capital and specialised expertise to support residential, industrial and commercial projects. From direct investment to mezzanine debt, stretch leverage and lease financing, we offer flexible solutions to a broad and diverse set of sponsors and clients.</span></p>

</div>

    


</div>

    

</div>
<div class="text"><div class="dark-text">
    
